<BaseLayout title="Privacy Notice — Keeper 2 Field Guide" description="How Keeper 2 Field Guide uses optional analytics and third-party media." path="/privacy/" noindex={true}>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
    <p>Keeper 2 Field Guide uses optional Google Analytics 4 to measure page visits and understand aggregate site usage. Analytics loads only after you choose “Allow analytics” on the production website. If you reject it, the Google Analytics script is not loaded on subsequent page visits.</p>
    <p>Your browser stores your analytics choice locally. When allowed, Google Analytics may use cookies and process technical information about your visit, including the page visited and browser or device information. We do not send names, email addresses, account identifiers, or form submissions. Enhanced measurement, Google signals, and advertising personalization are disabled.</p>
    <p>You can reject or withdraw permission through “Analytics choices” in the footer. Withdrawing consent stops consented analytics storage; previously collected data is not automatically deleted.</p>
    <p>This site does not enable advertising, accounts, or forms. The official YouTube trailer uses the privacy-enhanced youtube-nocookie.com domain and loads when you choose to play it. Loading or playing third-party media can contact YouTube.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
